      "writtenOn": "2022-12-20T21:36:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If an error occurs in one of these continues then `wdt_enabled[i]` is never set and `wdt_feed` never happens but is this guaranteed to result in a detectable response. I\u0027m not sure what the appropriate response would be (reboot?) but this failing might leave us in a state where the watchdog isn\u0027t running.\n\nI don\u0027t think this is a blocker for this CL because it doesn\u0027t appear to be new behavior (and may not be an issue, I\u0027m not certain).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 150,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 150,
        "endChar": 11
      },
      "revId": "4e7b0254608ece1172bf352bfe05d40a602397d9",
